OL,3,GNEWSAJacob and his grandad take Hull
OL,4,ACity to America
OL,5,
OL,6,FA grandad and grandson who made
OL,7,Fheadlines during the World Cup have
OL,8,Fflown to the US to promote the new
OL,9,FPremier League season.
OL,11,FThe story of Hull City fans Jacob
OL,12,FAllmendinger, 21, and Geoff Golliker,
OL,13,F80, went viral when Jacob spent his
OL,14,Flife savings so they could follow
OL,15,FEngland to the semi-finals of the
OL,16,Ftournament in North America in July.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
