OL,3,GNEWSAJacob and his grandad take Hull
OL,4,ACity to America
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow, the pair have been made Premier
OL,7,FLeague ambassadors and are in
OL,8,FCincinnati, Ohio, to bang the drum for
OL,9,Fthe Tigers' opening match against
OL,10,FManchester United, which kicks off at
OL,11,F12:30 BST.
OL,13,FGeoff said: "I feel really quite proud.
OL,14,FBeing asked to do this is an honour."
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
